{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33347","headline":"新岭临眺寄连总进士 · 欧阳玭","name":"新岭临眺寄连总进士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"关势遥临海，峰峦半入云。\n烟中独鸟下，潭上杂花熏。\n寄远悲春草，登临忆使君。\n此时还极目，离思更纷纷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳玭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33347.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33347","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}